  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;d till Kakheti Regional Development Foundation</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to Kakheti Regional Development Foundation - Support to Kakheti Regional Development Fund</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Objectives of the project are :

Economic and Social Empowerment of Women: The cooperation partner intends to achieve this objective through a variety of activities, including educational courses, capacity building for teachers, women empowerment trainings, entrepreneurship schools, and professional empowerment masterclasses. These activities are designed to enhance the skills, knowledge, and confidence of ethnic minority women, leading to increased economic independence, social participation, and entrepreneurship.

Intercultural Dialogue and Awareness: Through youth empowerment programs such as weekly sessions, cultural festivals, community dialogues, trainings, workshops, and sport competitions, the cooperation partner aims to promote understanding and cooperation among youth from diverse backgrounds.

And the last objective is to enhance KRDFs capacity and its effectiveness in implementing projects, achieving desired outcomes, and fostering positive socio-economic change at the local level</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Bidraget riktar sig till kvinnor och ungdomar samt socialt utsatta familjer i de samh&#xe4;llen som fr&#xe4;mst bebos av etniska och religi&#xf6;sa minoriteter i Kakheti-regionen. Genom att st&#xf6;dja den sociala integrationen bland marginaliserade grupper kommer kvinnor och ungdomar att f&#xe5; b&#xe4;ttre f&#xf6;ruts&#xe4;ttningar att p&#xe5; ett meningsfullt s&#xe4;tt delta i det civila och ekonomiska livet och bidra till att bygga ett inkluderande och r&#xe4;ttvist samh&#xe4;lle.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The contribution targets women and youth, and also socially vulnerable&#xa0;families&#xa0;in the targeted communities mainly inhabited by ethnic and religious minorities in Kakheti&#xa0;region. Supporting the social integration among&#xa0; marginalized communities will enable women and youth to be better positioned to meaningfully participate in civic and economic life and contribute to building an inclusive and equitable communities/society.</narrative>
  </description>
